# px93 (R-px93-1): the upgrade entry, chosen from the menu, never the
# default. `pax.upgrade` and the stick's own /pax/install-targets as a
# second module make kernel/fstab mount the listed disk's PAX root at
# /mnt/target for `pax-install --upgrade`; the entry above mounts nothing.
